title Taxonomy to Analysis Artifact Chain

participant Notebook
participant Pipeline
participant Runtime as DatasetAssemblyRuntimeEngine
participant MergeStage as run_merge_stage
participant Lineage as build_or_load_tax_accessor
participant Alpha as AlphaDiversityEngine
participant Abundance as TaxonomicAbundanceEngine
participant Results as Workspaces/<workspace>/results
participant Cache as results/_cache

Notebook->Runtime: run_taxonomy_stage(taxonomy_df, taxon_key_sep)
Runtime->Results: Ask_SLM_Taxon_Abundance_Matrix.csv
Runtime->Results: Ask_SLM_Taxon_Lookup.csv
Runtime->Cache: taxonomy_stage_stamp.json

Notebook->MergeStage: run_merge_stage(enriched_metadata_df, abundance_matrix, stamps)
MergeStage->Results: Ask_SLM_Analysis_Wide_Dataset.csv
MergeStage->Results: Ask_SLM_Metadata_Columns.json
MergeStage->Cache: merge_stage_stamp.json + Ask_SLM_Cache_Stamp.json

Notebook->Lineage: build_or_load_tax_accessor(taxon_lookup_df, taxonomy_stamp)
Lineage->Cache: compare taxonomy_lineage_db_stamp.json
Lineage->Cache: reuse or rebuild taxonomy_lineage_db.json

Notebook->Alpha: run(..., tax_accessor)
Alpha->Results: interactive analysis + optional exports

Notebook->Abundance: run(...)
Abundance->Results: interactive analysis + optional exports
